-center"><div class="col-lg-10 text-center"><img src=/images/apertvs.svg alt=Apertus class=mb-5 style=min-height:72px;max-width:100%><h1 class="display-5 fw-normal mb-4" style=line-height:1.2;color:#1a1a1a>Open weights, open data, open science</h1><p class="lead text-muted mb-5 mx-auto" style=max-width:680px;font-size:1.25rem;line-height:1.7>Fully Open Foundation Model for Sovereign AI &ndash; developed by the <a href=https://www.swiss-ai.org/ style=color:#e02d24;text-decoration:none;font-weight:500>Swiss&nbsp;AI&nbsp;Initiative</a> in collaboration between EPFL, ETH Zurich, and CSCS.</p><div class="d-flex justify-content-center gap-3 flex-wrap"><a href=/pages/get-started/ class="btn btn-lg px-4 py-3" style=background-color:#e02d24;color:#fff;border-radius:8px>Get Started
</a><a href=/pages/get-showcase/ class="btn btn-lg px-4 py-3" style=background-color:#7abfd8;color:#fff;border-radius:8px;border-color:#d1d5db>Showcase</a></div></div></div></div></section><style>html{overflow-y:scroll!important}body{font-size:1.125rem;min-height:calc(100vh + 1px)}.nav-link{font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:500}p,li{line-height:1.75}.row.g-5{--bs-gutter-x:5rem}.nav-link{color:#374151!important;transition:color .2s ease}.nav-link:hover{color:#49bed8!important}.nav-link.active{color:#49bed8!important}#main-nav{z-index:100;transition:background-color .3s,box-shadow .3s;background-color:transparent;box-shadow:none}@media(max-width:991px){#main-nav{background-color:#fff;box-shadow:0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}}#main-nav.scrolled{background-color:rgba(255,255,255,.95);box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}#nav-brand{opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .3s}#main-nav.scrolled #nav-brand{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}</style><nav id=main-nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg position-fixed scrolled top-0 w-100"><div class=container-fluid style=max-width:1100px><a id=nav-brand class=navbar-brand href=/><img src=/images/apertvs.svg alt=Apertus style=max-width:95%;max-height:18px>
</a><button class="navbar-toggler border-0" type=button data-bs-toggle=collapse data-bs-target=#navbarNav aria-controls=navbarNav aria-expanded=false aria-label="Toggle navigation">
<span class=navbar-toggler-icon></span></button><div class="collapse navbar-collapse justify-content-end" id=navbarNav><ul class="navbar-nav gap-4"><li class=nav-item><a class=nav-link href=/pages/get-started/>Get Started</a></li><li class=nav-item><a class=nav-link href=/pages/documentation/>Documentation</a></li><li class=nav-item><a class=nav-link href=/pages/research/>Research</a></li><li class=nav-item><a class=nav-link href=/pages/about/>About</a></li><li class=nav-item><a class=nav-link href=/contact/>Contact</a></li></ul></div></div></nav><section id=page-content class="pt-0 pb-5 bg-white"><div class=container style=max-width:1100px><div class="row g-5 py-4 text-left"><div class="col-12 col-md-4"><h3 id=fully-open>Fully Open</h3><p>Training data, code, weights, methods, alignment principles: all documented and reproducible. Apertus is to AI as Open is to Source.</p></div><div class="col-12 col-md-4"><h3 id=responsible-at-scale>Responsible at Scale</h3><p>A range of innovative techniques to respect opt-outs, remove PII, and prevent memorization. A global foundation to build on.</p></div><div class="col-12 col-md-4"><h3 id=run-for-performance>Run for Performance</h3><p>Competitive with top open models at an equivalent scale of 8B and 70B parameters. Multilingual from day one, trained on 1000+ languages.</p></div></div></div></section><div id=newsletter class=container style=max-width:1100px><h3 style=text-align:center;margin-top:3rem>Stay up-to-date on Apertus</h3><div style="max-width:500px;margin:0 auto 4rem"><form class=inf-form method=post action=https://newsletter.infomaniak.com/v3/api/1/newsletters/webforms/23060/submit style=display:flex;gap:.75rem;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center><input type=email name=email style=display:none>
